# SecureGate 2FA

Tagline: Verify your users in seconds.

Fast, reliable login codes via SMS and WhatsApp.

When a user logs in, they need that security code right now. If it takes even a minute, they're gone. SecureGate uses the fastest routes possible to get those codes to their phones in under 5 seconds. If SMS is slow, we automatically try WhatsApp to make sure they get in.

Key features:
- Flash Delivery: Sub-5-second latency. Happy users.
- Auto-Fallback: SMS -> WhatsApp -> Voice. Maximum delivery.
- Fraud Guard: Blocks fake traffic bots. Saves money.
- Global Reach: Works in 220 countries. Scale globally.

Benefits:
- Secure Logins
- Reduced Fraud
- Better UX
- Simple API

FAQs:

Q: How fast is it?
A: Average delivery globally is 3.5 seconds thanks to our "Priority Direct" operator routes.

Q: What if SMS fails?
A: The system automatically falls back to WhatsApp, and then a Voice call if needed, ensuring maximum arrival.

Q: Do we pay for failed codes?
A: No, you only pay for successfully delivered One-Time Passwords.

Q: How secure is the code?
A: Codes are generated using cryptographically secure random number generators and expire in 120 seconds.

Q: Does it work in China/India?
A: Yes, we have specialized local routes to bypass international filters in regulated markets.

Q: Do you have an SDK?
A: Yes, we have SDKs for Node.js, Python, PHP, Java, and Go.

Q: Can you stop "SMS Pumping"?
A: Yes, our Fraud Guard detects and blocks bot-driven traffic designed to drain your balance.

Q: Can I use my own sender name?
A: Yes, in supported countries, you can use an Alpha-Sender ID (e.g., your brand name).

Q: What does the "Flash Delivery" capability include?
A: Sub-5-second latency. The benefit: happy users.

Q: What does the "Auto-Fallback" capability include?
A: SMS -> WhatsApp -> Voice. The benefit: maximum delivery.